WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
Ideal weight packing is only one part of a runtime memory budget.

2
00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:12.000
At an assumed 12 GiB allocatable per pool: three for weights, four for the envelope.

3
00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:18.000
Each boundary adds latency plus serialization time before the next stage can proceed.

4
00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:24.000
More serial crossings raise a communication-only floor, not an achieved token rate.
